   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Naki Sunflower Oil Processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agri-processing of sunflower into edible oil.Beneficiaries; More than 2,000 people will be impacted directly and indirectly of which more than 1,000 will be women and youths..Description: The OAG grant will enhance the capacity of the farmers to increase sunflower production and productivity through accepatble agreicultural practices that take into account the climatic conditions. Famers will habve access to timely availability of agro-inputs and an assured market for their sunflower seed. Naki will enhance its financial management and control, enhance its capacity to keep and computerize records keeping and produce audited financial statements to measure business performance and meet statutory tax requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
